+Probe1's distinct prompt minted one phantom entry (`"Cycle 1105 lock-scope probe: distinct prompt variant"`) — recorded here for ledger honesty; per F2 it is expected to self-clear like the 03:06Z entry did. No route interrupted, no config touched, no credentials used.
